msgstr "يحتاج openvoxdb إلى قاعدة بيانات Postgres خاصة به، لا تُنشئها الحزمة:"

#: ../marketing/guides/operate/upgrade-postgres.md:81
msgid "openvoxdb refuses to start without the <code>pg_trgm</code> extension. The compose file only adds it when the database is first created, so a database that already existed needs it added by hand:"
